日记本：https://mizjeannie.com/daybook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Daybook for November 14, 2026: an illustrated King of Hearts, the daily reading, three favored magical focuses and their supporting timing windows." height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af84582d6f56.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:27:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11月14日黑色烟晶接骨木</title><link>https://some.pics/6af840967e0e5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月14日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;黑色 · 烟晶 · 接骨木&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 14, 2026. Color: Black — protection, banishing, boundaries, clearing. Crystal: Smoky Quartz — grounding, clearing, protection, release. Herb: Elder (Sambucus nigra) — protection, thresholds, healing, ancestor-work. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af840967e0e5.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:06:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚特兰大出城交通拥堵</title><link>https://some.pics/6af83ad788056</link><description>&lt;p&gt;驶出亚特兰大的交通堵得水泄不通。我真庆幸是我儿子在开车！我简直无法想象住在这一带的人每天是怎么应对这种状况的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A view of heavy traffic on an Atlanta highway, with multiple lanes of cars backed up beneath a series of concrete overpasses. A large electronic traffic sign hangs above the roadway, while a bright blue sky and scattered clouds are visible in the background." height="3191" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af83ad788056.jpg" width="4786"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:41:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>山羊道上竟有山羊</title><link>https://some.pics/6af83a08bec11</link><description>&lt;p&gt;甚至山羊小径上还有一只山羊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Zwarte geit" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af83a08bec11.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:38:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秋日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af837480682f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;秋天&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bomen met bruine bladeren aan water" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af837480682f.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:26:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>公园深处小憩早餐</title><link>https://some.pics/6af83660c78ff</link><description>&lt;p&gt;那里深处的一点公园，然后就吃早餐了&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Una foto del passeig de Vista Alegre des de la pinada de la platja del Carregador" height="2532" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jsanz/6af83660c78ff.jpg" width="3372"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jsanz.some.pics"&gt;@jsanz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:22:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚特兰大晴天堵车天际线</title><link>https://some.pics/6af835ce5f0f8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;阳光明媚的日子里亚特兰大天际线的全景。我在返回梅肯的路上堵车时从副驾驶座拍下了这张照片。亚特兰大有很多可玩的地方，但糟糕的交通堵塞大多数时候让我望而却步。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A panoramic view of the Atlanta skyline on a sunny day, featuring a cluster of modern glass and steel skyscrapers against a bright blue sky with scattered white clouds. The prominent Truist building rises near the center, with the Westin tower visible on the right. Trees and a busy roadway line the foreground." height="3359" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af835ce5f0f8.jpg" width="5039"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:20:02 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>